  "prompt": "Is 2025 churn worse in one segment? For each segment (accounts.segment), LedgerLoop's logo churn rate for 2025: of the accounts with MRR at the end of 2024 (a row in mrr_monthly for December 2024), the share that had a churn event (event_type churn in subscription_events) dated from 1 January to 31 December 2025. Count each account once, even if it churned twice; one that churned and came back still counts as churned. An account that started during 2025 is in neither count. Return four columns, in this order: segment, accounts_at_start, churned_accounts and churn_rate, as a share (0.02 for 2%), not rounded. Return one row per segment. Any row order is fine.",
